[CR CR0660r1 for 38.306] Reason for change: In RAN2#115e meeting, CR for introducing UE capability of txDiversity (R2-2108538) was agreed in principle. And it was agreed that formal CR can be approved when RAN4 has completed the phase 1 requirements. In RAN4#100e meeting, formal cat.B CR for phase1 requirements was approved (R4-2115100). Hence the CR agreed in principle (R2-2108538) can be formally approved. Summary of change: Introduce a new Rel-16 capability of txDiversity-r16 in the section of BandNR parameters. The capability is per band and applies to FR1 only. Impact analysis Impacted 5G architecture options: (NG)EN-DC, NR SA, NE-DC, NR-DC Impacted functionality: Tx Diversity capability Inter-operability: 1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, the UE cannot report the transparent Tx Diversity capability. 2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there is no compatibility issues. Consequences if not approved: Tx Diversity capability cannot be supported.

